WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.660
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to do at&nbsp;
the Foundation: Dr. Bright! No infinite loops!

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.620
This one should be self-explanatory.&nbsp;
Dr. Bright is not allowed to create&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:13.700
infinite logical loops to torment his&nbsp;
colleagues and give them headaches. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.480
have more important things to do. What if&nbsp;
the apocalypse happens because you couldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.840
resist messing with someone’s head?&nbsp;
There will be egg on your face then.

